# H-NT-DECIDE-1: the held-out guard (and the clock reference NT-CORPUS places here) are pinned by sha256 of their BYTES
# (--nt-heldout-sha256 on the trainer argv; the launch gate binds it). A Windows checkout under core.autocrlf=true would
# write them CRLF and the pinned hash would no longer match the file (measured 2026-10-21): keep them LF everywhere.
* text eol=lf
/.gitattributes text eol=lf
